  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Spacious, 5800 Heated and cooled square foot home, ideal for large family reunions and wedding housing for park weddings. 7 bedrooms 7.5 baths.14 Wristbands with this house! This is one of the popular rental homes in Watercolor.You are only 200 yards to the main beach club where everyone wants to go. Home has been featured in Orlando Magazine and in Tuscaloosa Magazines Spring 2011 Beach issue.New indoor and outdoor paint 2020. Home is available year around. Check calendar for available dates. We keep our calendar current. This house has every amenity you could ever want in a vacation home. The house is located in the Heart of Watercolor on Cerulean Park in Phase I at 82 Watercolor Blvd. East. While you sit and relax on large front screen porch (11X35) you can watch your kids play on the park across the street. <br><br>You are located 50 yards to the Marina Pool and fishing dock. We are 200 yards to the famous Beach Club Pool and fine dining at the FOW restaurant.Camp Watercolor phase 2 pool has waterslide and lazy river. From the beach club, you are a short walk or very quick bike ride to our famous white sand beaches and emerald color water.You are 300 yards to Seaside and all the restaurants and shops.Wine Bar and new Scratch Breakfast place 100 yards from the house. <br><br>Downstairs has a large living area, Gourmet Kitchen, new countertops 4/15/22) including 2 Bosch dishwashers, 2 Sub Zero refrigerators, 48 inch Wolf gas cooktop, wine cooler, bar with ice machine(crushed ice), warming drawer, washer dryer, 65 inch Flat Screen LED TV above Fireplace, Screen porch(11X35) with Swing, Gas Grill, 12 foot wood beam ceilings, work desk with wireless Internet, large Master with King bed, two headed shower, Jacuzzi, and an outside shower. Charcoal Grill in open garage. <br><br>Upstairs has two large masters with King beds in each, baths with shower, tub and 2 sinks, one has private den off of the room with twin bed and other master has a King and twin in a nook in the same room, there is another guest room with King and twin bed in loft, Kids bunk room with 2 full bunks(4 full beds) and televisions in bunks, another washer and dryer room upstairs, large playroom king size bed with full Kitchen and 2 twin mattress beds in loft, bathroom, and a 3rd set of washer and dryers.Pool table.Large flat screen LED TV/Stereo.<br>Keurig Regular filter coffee maker. <br>The tower has a nice office with Desk, bar, Flat ScreenTV, wireless Internet, nice deck for viewing Cerulean Park and Watercolor. With every reservation through Grayton Coast Rentals you receive a free\"Beach Gear\" credit of $280 where you can order bikes, paddle boards, or anything they offer up to $280 for the week or $40 per day if less than a week. <br><br>Bedroom 1 -1 King, Main Master 1st floor, private bath<br>Bedroom 2 -1 King, 1 Twin, master on 2nd floor, private bath<br>Bedroom 3 - 1 King, 1 Twin in Den, 3rd master, private bath 2nd floor<br>Bedroom 4 - 1 King, 1 Twin in loft, private bath, 2nd floor<br>Bedroom 5 - 1 Twin bunk set, 2nd floor, private bath<br>Bedroom 6 - 2 Full bunk sets, 2nd floor, private bath, across hall from bedroom 4<br>Bedroom 7 - carriage house 1 King bed, 2 Twins, 2nd floor, private bath/playroom/kitchen<br>1/2 bath<br>Note!!! 14 wristbands Max with this home. Children 4 and under do not need bands. No exceptions.<br><br>Dining. 8 at the main table 5 on stools at kitchen bar<br>4 more at the table in the corner of dining area.All these tables in the same room.<br><br>Screen Porch table-4, If home not available ask about our large Rental Houses great for family gatherings at Grayton Beach one mile to the west(100 yds to Red Bar) which are available year around and our others of various sizes.Many with pools, lake front with docks,Gulf views, and perfect for your family vacation.<br><br>No fitness at Watercolor but Grayton Fitness is 2 miles away to west,<br><br>Parking for up to 5 cars. Do not block alleyway behind the house. HOA gives one parking pass per house. It is public parking on park out front. (no pass required)<br><br><br>14 Wristbands max! Pet friendly with Pet fee.",
