            "id": "c8698161-7141-4e1a-bed0-caf1a8a94e43",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thomas thank you so much for your nice review and comments on the 82 Watercolor Blvd. home. Great big home right on the big park and close to Seaside and Watercolor Beach Club. We look forward to having you each year.",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "This is our fourth or fifth time staying at this house. We absolutely love it. Great house for a large family gatherings and is in a perfect location in watercolor.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
