      },
      {
        "author": "Thomas E.",
        "date": "2025-11-30T10:31:00Z",
        "id": "692d97cc0b83cd0f8b177889",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Rating Details:\nThe property manager was very helpful.\nThe vacation rental was spotless.\nI was very happy with the location.\nI was very satisfied with the condition of the vacation rental.\nOverall, I recommend this vacation rental.\n\nReviewer Comments:\nThis is our 4th or 5th time staying at this house over the years. It is our favorite house in Watercolor. Perfect location. A large home that can accommodate a large family. I highly recommend it.",
        "title": "Our favorite house in watercolor"
      },
      {
        "author": "Danielle J.",
        "date": "2025-10-23T13:59:32Z",
        "id": "68fa43596fb3ce5187764531",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Awesome house and perfect location to the beach, town center, and watercolor amenities! We had 10 kids under 6 years old and stayed with 3 other families. The house setup was perfect for multiple families. One note, there is a ladder in one room and the bunks are pretty high for small kids, but we just blocked the spaces off. Will definitely rent again!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "verified": true
      },
      {
