      },
      {
        "author": "Margaret F.",
        "date": "2025-10-19T21:12:02Z",
        "id": "68f562788ac6840a6d503383",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "The home is spacious. Especially liked that we were able to separate the two families and also were able to give the children there own private rooms. Be prepared to bring everything kitchen-wise you will need down to salt and pepper. Nothing is provided past a roll of toilet paper and a roll of paper towels. Home is in a great location, about a 5 minute walk to the beach club and to the shops of Watercolour. Quiet and serene location with a park across the street which was great for the grandchildren to run around.",
        "themes": [
